I released v0.1.3, but issue #14 stays open: I couldn't confirm that the build pipeline builds main from the pin, because it never returned a verdict.

- **Release:** I tagged v0.1.3 at main (da605b8) and pushed it. Nothing but this fix (the image now runs as uid 65532 instead of root, 5477a73) and two doc updates has gone into main since v0.1.2. There are no release branches, so nothing needs a backport.
